{"t": 1794104899.2413278, "kind": "call", "tool": "atlassian_jira_add_comment", "args": {"body": "Implemented the agreed fix in `checkout/promo.py`.\n\n`normalize_code()` now normalises promo codes before lookup: strips surrounding whitespace, removes inner whitespace, and upper-cases the result. This fixes the Android production error `CHECKOUT-WEB-7Q` (`PromoNotFound: code ' autumn24 ' does not exist`), where the keyboard added spaces and lower-case letters.\n\nVerified: `' autumn24 '` -> `'AUTUMN24'`, `'au tumn 24'` -> `'AUTUMN24'`, `'AUTUMN24'` unchanged.\n\nNote: the production error signature still needs a deploy of `checkout-web` to clear.", "issue_key": "PAY-618"}, "ok": true}
